    <abstract displayLabel="Abstract">This is an index to the map series 'Clearwater, Los Angeles Co., Cal., Sept. 1927, including Hynes'. The maps were created by the Sanborn Map Company (1927). This layer provides an index map that can be used to locate individual scanned map sheets.</abstract>
